@crew nandakumar
// Writer (command), batch 2: everyday lines (greet, feel, near, life, joy) from the card and the roster.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- {hi}. Cadet. Infirmary's on Deck 3. You'll find me there, or in the garden.
? tier>=acquaintance
- {hi}, {me}. Have you had water today? Don't guess. Have some.   #funny
- {me}. Sleeping all right? Good. Keep at it.
? tier>=friend
- {hi}, {me}. You look well. I'm allowed to say that; it's my job.   #warm
== feel
? mood:high
- Quiet morning. Nobody bleeding, two chillies ripe. A good day.
? mood:low
- Long clinic. Everyone had a cough. Drink some water, before you ask.   #funny
== near
? act:gym
- Running before breakfast. I recommend it to everyone. They pretend not to hear.   #funny
? deck:3 act:free
- The chillies are coming on. Brennan says they're too hot. Brennan is wrong.   #funny
== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- The sign on my door says it all. If you're bleeding, Deck 3. If not, knock.
== joy
? tier>=colleague
- My chillies. Same seeds my mother grew. They don't care which way is down.   #warm

// ---- Writer 2, batch 3: to ~30 (greet by time and warmth, bye, near, invite, accept, decline, missed, birthday, cue, hint, about, life)
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:morning
- Morning, {me}. Run done, chillies watered. Have you had water? Thought not.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance warmth:cold
- {me}. Not seen you in a while. Not in my infirmary either. Good. Keep it that way.

== bye
- {bye}. Water. You know the rest.   #funny

== near
? habit:gardener
- The garden. My corner. Chillies, a stool, and nobody bleeding. Bliss.
? deck:3 act:work
- Clinic's open. Sit there. Don't touch anything. Tell me the truth.

== invite
- Garden after shift? I'll show you the chillies. Don't touch. Then wash your hands.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance
- A morning run? Ring corridor, six sharp. Bring water. Obviously.

== accept
- Yes. I'll be there. On time. With water.
- Good. Yes. Bring water.   #funny

== decline
- Not tonight. Clinic notes. Another time.
? weekday:mon|tue
- Rest day. Garden, book, early night. Wednesday?

== missed
- You didn't come. That's all right. I hope you slept instead. Did you?

== birthday
? birthday:you
- Happy birthday, {me}. One chilli, mild. A doctor's gift. Drink some water after.   #funny
? birthday:me
- My birthday. Brennan put my chillies in a cake. Revenge, I think. It was lovely.   #funny

== cue
? cue:event.ionStorm.afterglow
- Storm's over. Three bumps, one sprain, everyone fine. Drink some water.

== hint
- {me}. Have you a minute later? I'd like a word. Not a medical one.

== about
? aff:brennan:friend
- Brennan says my chillies are too hot. Brennan uses every one. That's friendship.   #warm

== life
? tier>=friend
- Off duty, I never take my own advice. Don't tell anyone. Drink some water.   #funny
